## Editor leftovers
*~
*.swp
*.bak
.claude/settings.local.json

## Raw experiment logs (~660 MB). They live next to the scripts that read them, in
## experiments/*/data/, so `make` can redraw every figure from them, but they are far
## too large for git. The rendered PDFs under experiments/*/figures/ and the small
## derived JSON/CSV under experiments/*/derived/ are committed, so a clone without the
## logs still compiles the paper.
experiments/*/data/
